  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Posta la Mesa</p>\r\n<p>Extensive archaeological fieldwork (geophysical and pedestrian surveys) in the area of\u00a0<em>Ad Medias\u00a0</em>have been conducted by the Groningen Institute of Archaeology, revealing a wealth of multi-period features.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Ad Medias was a mutatio on the ancient Via Appia. It was located at the halfway point of the so-called Decennovium.",
